                <head>No. 51<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi></head>
                <p>On September 10, Secretary Acheson made a statement at a press conference
                    denouncing the treatment of Americans imprisoned in Communist China and
                    specifically discussing four cases of Americans who had died in prison or
                    shortly after their release; the text of his statement is printed in Department
                    of State <hi rendition="#italic">Bulletin</hi>, September 22, 1952, page
                    440.</p>
            </div>
